Source: shellos-boot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sahil Patki <161210761+sahil-mpatki@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: shellos-boot
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, limine (>= 12), efibootmgr, btrfs-progs, snapper, initramfs-tools, util-linux, findutils
Description: ShellOS boot integration (Limine + Btrfs snapshots)
 Keeps kernels on the EFI system partition, generates the Limine menu with
 a safe mode, older kernels and bootable Snapper snapshots (RAM overlay),
 and provides shellos-rollback to promote a snapshot to the root.
